      <h2>Payments that rise and fall with your sales.</h2>
      <p>With revenue-based financing, you receive capital upfront and repay it through small, automatic daily or weekly payments tied to your revenue. Your total payback is fixed from day one — if repayment takes a little longer during a slow stretch, the amount you owe doesn't grow.</p>
      <ul class="checks">
        <li>$5,000 to $300,000 in upfront capital</li>
        <li>Estimated 3 to 12 month payment period</li>
        <li>Fixed total payment amount</li>
        <li>Approval based on business performance, not just credit</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="/revenue-based-financing" class="btn btn-navy">Learn About RBF</a>
    </div>
    <div class="steps-mini">
      <div class="sm"><span>1</span><div><h4>Apply online</h4><p>Tell us about your business and upload four months of bank statements.</p></div></div>
      <div class="sm"><span>2</span><div><h4>Review your offers</h4><p>A funding advisor walks you through the amount, term and payment options.</p></div></div>
      <div class="sm"><span>3</span><div><h4>Get funded</h4><p>Sign your agreement and receive funds directly in your business account.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

