<section class="sec sec-alt">
  <div class="wrap faq-wrap">
    <div class="sec-head left">
      <p class="eyebrow dark">Common questions</p>
      <h2>Before you apply</h2>
      <a href="/faq" class="link">See all FAQs →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="faq">
      <details><summary>What do I need to apply?</summary><p>Basic business and owner information plus your last four months of business bank statements. The application takes about 10 minutes.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How long does approval take?</summary><p>Many applications are reviewed within a few business days. Larger or more complex requests can take up to a couple of weeks.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How do I qualify?</summary><p>We look at your business revenue, time in business, credit history and the type of funding you need.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What if I miss a payment?</summary><p>Contact us right away. Depending on your situation, options may include restructuring your payments or a short grace period.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
